# Ownership for cgv-data, the published distribution repository.
#
# REPLACE every @OWNER_* placeholder below with a real GitHub user or team.
# A team must be written as @org/team-name and must have write access.
#
# Publisher automation should NOT be a code owner: a generated release still
# needs a human reviewer.

*                                   @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME

# Normative rules and the safeguards themselves.
/DATA_CONTRACT.md                   @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD
/AGENTS.md                          @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD
/schemas/                           @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD
/scripts/check-data-contract.py     @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD
/.github/                           @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME
/.data-contract-baseline.json       @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD

# Published Bible datasets. LBF is generated from Biblia-LBF and must not be
# hand-edited here.
/bibles/LBF/                        @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @LBF_RELEASE_MANAGER
/bibles/                            @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME
/interlinears/                      @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @LBF_RELEASE_MANAGER
/morphology/                        @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME

# Other published content.
/songs/                             @CGV_CONTENT_OWNER
/courses/                           @CGV_CONTENT_OWNER
/media/                             @CGV_CONTENT_OWNER
/dictionaries/                      @CGV_CONTENT_OWNER
/lexicons/                          @CGV_CONTENT_OWNER
